---
// Server-rendered per request (site-wide `output: 'server'`, no `prerender` override) —
// see astro.config.mjs / README § "Deployment routing": prerendered pages upload as static
// index.html and only match Wix's static-asset layer by exact literal path, so clean URLs
// like /services 404. SSR still returns full real HTML in the initial response, just
// generated at request time instead of pre-built at deploy time.

// Real content per README § Content Status ("Real: all service names and prices, VOS
// package tiers") — hardcoded here from design-source/Services.dc.html's data, same
// treatment as Business Consulting's pricing. CMS wiring (so Danielle can edit these
// without a developer) is blocked on Wix CMS collections that don't exist yet — same
// situation as the step-5 contact form: `collections.createDataCollection` / `list`
// both 403 under visitor auth, creating them requires her Wix dashboard access. See
// README § CMS collections for the exact schema to set up once she does.

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

