    <h2 class="section-title2" style="margin-bottom:10px;">business consulting</h2>
    <p class="section-lede2">
      Coaching and strategic consulting for owners who want clarity before they build. Choose the experience
      that fits where you are right now.
    </p>
    <div class="tier-grid tier-grid--consulting">
